#: includes/class-abilities.php:378
msgid "List Replies"
msgstr "回复列表"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:379
msgid ""
"List replies for a forum post with pagination. Includes author info, vote "
"scores, and thread structure."
msgstr "分页列出话题的回复，包含作者信息、投票得分和回复层级结构。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:442
msgid "Vote on Content"
msgstr "为内容投票"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:443
msgid ""
"Upvote or downvote a post or reply. Toggles if voting the same direction "
"again."
msgstr "对话题或回复投赞成票或反对票。再次向同一方向投票将取消该票。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:486
msgid "Authentication required."
msgstr "需要身份验证。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:510
msgid "List Spaces"
msgstr "版块列表"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:511
msgid ""
"List all community spaces (forums, Q&A boards, idea boards) the current "
"user can access, grouped by category."
msgstr "按分类分组，列出当前用户可访问的所有社区版块（论坛、问答版块、创意版块）。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:554
msgid "Get Space Details"
msgstr "获取版块详情"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:555
msgid ""
"Retrieve detailed information about a community space including "
"description, rules, member count, and settings."
msgstr "获取社区版块的详细信息，包括描述、规则、成员数和设置。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:600
msgid "Join Space"
msgstr "加入版块"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:601
msgid ""
"Join a community space as a member. For private spaces, this submits a join "
"request for moderator approval."
msgstr "以成员身份加入社区版块。对于私密版块，此操作会提交加入申请，等待版主审批。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:644
msgid "List Space Members"
msgstr "版块成员列表"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:645
msgid ""
"List members of a community space with their roles, trust levels, and "
"reputation."
msgstr "列出社区版块的成员及其角色、信任等级和声望。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:691
msgid "Create Space"
msgstr "创建版块"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:692
msgid ""
"Create a new community space (forum, Q&A, ideas, or social). Requires "
"administrator or jetonomy_manage_settings capability."
msgstr "创建新的社区版块（论坛、问答、创意或社交）。需要管理员身份或 jetonomy_manage_settings 权限。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:762
msgid "Get User Profile"
msgstr "获取用户个人资料"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:763
msgid ""
"Retrieve a community member's profile including bio, trust level, "
"reputation, post/reply counts, and badges."
msgstr "获取社区成员的个人资料，包括简介、信任等级、声望、话题/回复数和徽章。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:807
msgid "List Notifications"
msgstr "通知列表"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:808
msgid ""
"List the current user's community notifications (replies, mentions, votes, "
"badges) with read/unread status."
msgstr "列出当前用户的社区通知（回复、提及、投票、徽章）及其已读/未读状态。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:860
msgid "Mark Notifications Read"
msgstr "将通知标为已读"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:861
msgid "Mark one or all of the current user's notifications as read."
msgstr "将当前用户的一条或全部通知标为已读。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:901
msgid "Get Activity Feed"
msgstr "获取动态流"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:902
msgid ""
"Retrieve the community activity feed showing recent posts, replies, votes, "
"and other events."
msgstr "获取社区动态流，显示最近的话题、回复、投票及其他事件。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:970
msgid "Flag Content"
msgstr "举报内容"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:971
msgid ""
"Report a post, reply or member for moderator review. Provide a reason "
"(spam, offensive, off_topic, harassment, other)."
msgstr "向版主举报话题、回复或成员以供审核。请提供原因（spam、offensive、off_topic、harassment、other）。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1031
msgid "Moderate Content"
msgstr "审核内容"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1032
msgid ""
"Take moderation action on flagged content. Approve, trash, or mark as spam. "
"Requires moderator or administrator role."
msgstr "对被举报的内容执行审核操作：批准、移至回收站或标记为垃圾内容。需要版主或管理员角色。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1084
msgid "List Pending Flags"
msgstr "待处理举报列表"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1085
msgid ""
"List all pending content flags awaiting moderator review. Requires "
"moderator or administrator role."
msgstr "列出所有等待版主审核的内容举报。需要版主或管理员角色。"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1132
msgid "Search Community"
msgstr "搜索社区"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1133
msgid ""
"Full-text search across posts, spaces, and tags. Supports filtering by type "
"(posts, spaces, tags, all) and returns ranked results."
msgstr "在话题、版块和标签中进行全文搜索。支持按类型（话题、版块、标签、全部）筛选，并返回按相关度排序的结果。"

